  "body": "The `beforeinput` event was added to the UI events specification, but there is no easy way to feature detect it because `onbeforeinput` was not added to any interface. Mozilla seems to want to add this when they implement support for the event - https://github.com/w3c/uievents/issues/218\r\n\r\nI can try and add it to HTML specification, seems easy enough...",
